  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> has two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-intercepts one is positive and one is negative and vertex is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. The graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2ea76fa3-d1ce-4ab3-ae57-cb22a3955241-image.png\" style=\"width: 268px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Clearly from graph</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
